			"text": "\"I stumble back frighten by the sudden appearance of a strange new person\""
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742246608.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "who are yo-mff"
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742244059.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "shhh be quiet, don't you hear them"
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742246608.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "..."
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742246608.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "hear who"
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742244059.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "the \"voices\""
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742246608.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "\"she's clearly insane\""
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742244059.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "I've been hearing a lot of voices around the school lately…"
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742244059.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "Something sinister is happening in this school, and I’m gonna get to the bottom of it"
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742246608.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "Erm… I’m not sure I'm following"
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742244059.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "I’ve been hearing people talking about sedating the students"
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742244059.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "Something about compliance or better test scores, whatever It doesn’t matter."
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742244059.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "I don’t know who or where the voices are coming from, but I do know that for some reason you can hear them super well from the basement"
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742246608.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "Is that why you were down here? You were eavesdropping?"
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742244059.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "Eavesdropping? What kind of person do you think I am?"
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742244059.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "I always come down here. I just so happened to accidentally overhear a few things this time…"
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742246608.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "\"Yeah..okay..\""
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742246608.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "What are you planning on doing anyways? Are you going to go all hero and save the school?"
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742244059.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": " don't exactly have a plan yet…. But we can come up with something once we get out of here."
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742246608.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "We?"
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742244059.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "Yeah, you think I’d just let you go off after hearing all this top-secret jazz?"
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742244059.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "You’re stuck with me now"
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742244059.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "Can’t have you spoiling my plans"
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742246608.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "\"great… just what I needed to start off the school year\""
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742244059.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "Great, now let's get outta here. This place reeks"
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742246608.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "\"you see emy open the door and walk down a hallway and in to a room you\nfollow her in  and hear a loud thump on the other side of the door\" "
		},
		{
			"character": "character-1742244059.json",
			"event_id": "dialogic_001",
			"portrait": "",
			"text": "and now just to find that key to open the door back up stairs, so help me find it so we can escape"
		},
